'''High Countess Koryessa''' (ダイコワラッキョ夫人, ''Dai Kowarakkyo Fujin'', '''Lady Great Kowalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Countess Koryessa]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. She was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

