==Enemy==
A supersized version of [[Countess Koryessa]], boasting far higher stats across the board and an absolutely ginormous standing range of 600. Level 10 [[Wave Attack]]s ensure she hits all cats on the field that are not already immune to Waves, making her a very powerful threat that cannot be stopped by traditional crowd-control thanks to the enemies she's usually accompanied by. In spite of this, she has a very slow attack rate of nearly 10 seconds, making her vulnerable to sneak attacks!

==Strategy==
With the exception of [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] (specifically for his Resistance ability and Wave Immunity [[Cat Combo]]) and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]], [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] are largely ineffective against High Countess Koryessa. Your best bet is to time rushers like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to deal heavy damage to her over time. It is also possible to use Green Cat in conjunction with [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to Freeze this enemy in her tracks, but her support usually hinders the latter and makes him difficult to use.

